he likes spicy food.

991
00:39:26,063 --> 00:39:27,698
They're adding piles of hot pepper.

992
00:39:27,765 --> 00:39:30,434
He's now grilling
garlic cloves on the gridiron.

993
00:39:30,501 --> 00:39:33,938
He's char-grilling
onion, green onion, and garlic.

994
00:39:34,004 --> 00:39:36,907
-The small intestines look good.
-Those look great too.

995
00:39:36,974 --> 00:39:39,443
Don't small intestines become tough

996
00:39:39,510 --> 00:39:41,379
