1047
00:41:34,024 --> 00:41:36,360
-What's that?
-Sea cucumber intestines.

1048
00:41:36,427 --> 00:41:38,128
-Sea cucumber intestines.
-Sea cucumber.

1049
00:41:38,195 --> 00:41:39,063
THIS IS OFFAL TOO!

1050
00:41:39,129 --> 00:41:41,298
-Something smells good.
-It already smells delicious.

1051
00:41:41,365 --> 00:41:42,766
Yes, something smells so good.

1052
00:41:43,334 --> 00:41:46,570
-Are you grilling them this time?
-He puts them on the gridiron

1053
00:41:46,637 --> 00:41:49,373
