1055
00:41:52,243 --> 00:41:53,277
BANG!

1056
00:41:53,344 --> 00:41:54,545
That looks good.

1057
00:41:54,612 --> 00:41:55,813
-Ho-young!
-Flame-grilled!

1058
00:41:55,880 --> 00:41:58,616
-He's grilling them over the flame!
-It smells great, Ho-young!

1059
00:41:58,682 --> 00:42:01,285
It smells so good!

1060
00:42:01,352 --> 00:42:03,454
