1061
00:42:03,521 --> 00:42:05,422
It smells really great.

1062
00:42:05,990 --> 00:42:07,491
Are those burnt?

1063
00:42:07,558 --> 00:42:08,425
No, they're fine.

1064
00:42:08,492 --> 00:42:10,394
-Aren't those burnt?
-They look burnt.

1065
00:42:10,461 --> 00:42:12,563
-They look burnt.
-Open it and take a look.

1066
00:42:12,630 --> 00:42:14,431
-Cut it out.
-Open it.

1067
00:42:14,498 --> 00:42:15,799
Cut it out.

1068
00:42:15,866 --> 00:42:17,601
Whoa! Hey!

1069
00:42:17,868 --> 00:42:19,637
OPENED!

1070
00:42:20,137 --> 00:42:22,540
Doesn't that look burnt?

1071
00:42:22,606 --> 00:42:25,409
