1079
00:42:39,356 --> 00:42:41,325
-Nam-no, five minutes.
-Five minutes.

1080
00:42:41,392 --> 00:42:44,128
Five minutes left.
Please report from the scene.

1081
00:42:44,194 --> 00:42:46,196
-Five minutes.
-It smells delicious.

1082
00:42:46,263 --> 00:42:47,898
My goodness.

1083
00:42:47,965 --> 00:42:49,266
-Gosh.
-Try this piece.

1084
00:42:49,333 --> 00:42:50,868
-This is for me?
-Yes.

1085
00:42:50,935 --> 00:42:52,102
What's this?

1086
00:42:52,169 --> 00:42:54,405
-What was it? What did you eat?
-The spinal cord?

1087
00:42:54,471 --> 00:42:56,140
-The spinal cord.
-What is this?

1088
00:42:56,206 --> 00:42:57,308
The spinal cord.

1089
00:42:57,374 --> 00:42:58,943
-The spinal cord.
-The spinal cord.

1090
00:42:59,009 --> 00:42:59,944
Seasoned spinal cord.

1091
00:43:00,010 --> 00:43:01,879
There's zero funky smell

1092
00:43:01,946 --> 00:43:03,948
in the spinal cord.

1093
00:43:04,014 --> 00:43:06,150
It feels like soft gummy candy.

1094
00:43:06,216 --> 00:43:08,152
-Chewy.
-And it's refreshing.

1095
00:43:08,218 --> 00:43:10,087
-That sounds good.
-Very good.

1096
00:43:10,154 --> 00:43:13,524
Now, he gave me a piece of this.
What is it?

1097
00:43:13,591 --> 00:43:14,825
-Small intestine.
-Right?

1098
00:43:14,892 --> 00:43:15,926
All right. This one.

1099
00:43:15,993 --> 00:43:18,195
THE OFFAL DISH
HE LEARNED TO MAKE IN OSAKA!

1100
00:43:18,262 --> 00:43:20,664
Do you think the offal will get

1101
00:43:20,731 --> 00:43:22,533
a successful makeover?

1102
00:43:25,636 --> 00:43:27,771
OH, GOODNESS, MMM!

1103
00:43:27,838 --> 00:43:29,106
-Is it good?
-It's so good.

1104
00:43:30,574 --> 00:43:33,277
I love the fatty filling shooting out.

1105
00:43:33,344 --> 00:43:34,211
I love it.

1106
00:43:34,278 --> 00:43:36,146
You need that fatty filling.

1107
00:43:36,213 --> 00:43:37,648
8. ADD CHAR-GRILLED VEGGIES

1108
00:43:37,715 --> 00:43:39,783
-He's using the spinal cord too.
-Beef spinal cord!

1109
00:43:39,850 --> 00:43:41,352
He's using it too?

1110
00:43:41,418 --> 00:43:43,053
It's the topping.

1111
00:43:43,120 --> 00:43:45,289
You'll just top your dish with that?

1112
00:43:45,356 --> 00:43:46,423
Is that okay?

1113
00:43:46,490 --> 00:43:48,726
9. SEASON SPINAL CORD
WITH SALT, GARLIC, AND SESAME OIL

