00:43:48,792 --> 00:43:50,394
Gosh. Three minutes left.

1115
00:43:50,461 --> 00:43:52,963
I want to know
what the tomato soy sauce is like.

1116
00:43:53,030 --> 00:43:55,299
-The tomato soy sauce.
-This one?

1117
00:43:55,366 --> 00:43:56,333
The tomato… Yes.

1118
00:43:56,400 --> 00:43:58,302
It must be the sauce…

1119
00:43:58,369 --> 00:44:00,671
-It's the sauce, right?
-…for his cold dish.

1120
00:44:00,738 --> 00:44:03,540
Do you think Hang-jun will
save that flavor in his heart?

1121
00:44:03,607 --> 00:44:06,343
Do you think Hang-jun will
save that flavor in his heart?

1122
00:44:06,410 --> 00:44:09,079
Well, I want to.

1123
00:44:09,913 --> 00:44:11,515
This is really good.

1124
00:44:11,582 --> 00:44:13,350
I think it could be a huge hit.

1125
00:44:13,417 --> 00:44:14,318
Isn't it too sweet?

1126
00:44:14,385 --> 00:44:15,719
-It's not sweet.
-No? Okay.

1127
00:44:15,786 --> 00:44:19,623
That was delicious and refreshing.

1128
00:44:19,690 --> 00:44:22,226
It also tastes healthy,
thanks to tomatoes.

1129
00:44:22,292 --> 00:44:23,594
Two minutes left.

1130
00:44:23,661 --> 00:44:26,330
-Two minutes.
-What's that? What's he adding?

1131
00:44:26,397 --> 00:44:28,399
-Beef heart.
-Beef heart!

1132
00:44:28,465 --> 00:44:30,467
