1135
00:44:35,305 --> 00:44:37,207
-I made it with monkfish liver.
-Monkfish liver soup.

1136
00:44:37,274 --> 00:44:38,342
That's new.

1137
00:44:38,409 --> 00:44:39,777
-I see.
-Monkfish liver soup.

1138
00:44:39,843 --> 00:44:42,246
Ho-young tries it himself.

1139
00:44:42,312 --> 00:44:44,081
He studied in Osaka for three years!

1140
00:44:44,148 --> 00:44:46,817
-It must've been too salty.
-It's too salty.

1141
00:44:46,884 --> 00:44:48,218
-Too salty.
-Too salty.

1142
00:44:48,285 --> 00:44:50,220
-Too salty.
-Oh, man.

1143
00:44:50,421 --> 00:44:51,522
FEELING DIZZY

1144
00:44:52,089 --> 00:44:53,357
-That can be you soon.
-Exactly.

1145
00:44:53,424 --> 00:44:54,825
You can't spare a smile right now!

1146
00:44:54,892 --> 00:44:56,126
That can be you.

1147
00:44:56,193 --> 00:44:57,728
-I'm so nervous.
-Got it?

1148
00:44:57,795 --> 00:45:00,264
-It's too salty.
-Too salty?

1149
00:45:00,330 --> 00:45:03,033
But I like this light flavor.

1150
00:45:03,100 --> 00:45:05,469
-Wow.
-I like how it's different.

1151
00:45:05,536 --> 00:45:07,938
You just have to make it less salty.

1152
00:45:08,005 --> 00:45:11,475
You should taste it again
after he puts everything together.

1153
00:45:11,542 --> 00:45:13,410
-This one. I must taste it now.
-Yes.

1154
00:45:13,477 --> 00:45:15,913
-It's important.
-A minute and a half left.

1155
00:45:15,979 --> 00:45:19,083
Do you want to bring your offal to him?

1156
00:45:19,149 --> 00:45:21,418
Do you want to bring your offal to him?

1157
00:45:21,485 --> 00:45:22,453
Chef &…

1158
00:45:22,519 --> 00:45:23,353
SLAP

1159
00:45:23,420 --> 00:45:24,421
-…My Offal!
-My Offal!

1160
00:45:24,488 --> 00:45:26,323
-Chef & My Offal!
-My Offal!

1161
00:45:26,390 --> 00:45:28,325
IN UNISON

1162
00:45:28,392 --> 00:45:29,359
This is great.

1163
00:45:30,127 --> 00:45:32,596
I love this one.

1164
00:45:32,663 --> 00:45:34,264
I'd like it to be spicier.

1165
00:45:34,331 --> 00:45:35,299
A bit spicier?

1166
00:45:35,365 --> 00:45:37,067
-Cheongyang pepper.
-Cheongyang pepper.

1167
00:45:37,134 --> 00:45:40,270
-It can be spicier. It's a bit too mild.
-That's it.

1168
00:45:40,337 --> 00:45:43,741
-Hurry up.
-The timer has turned red.

1169
00:45:43,807 --> 00:45:46,310
That one with the monkfish liver
looks really good.

1170
00:45:46,610 --> 00:45:48,445
NAM-NO BEGINS TO PLATE HIS DISH TOO

1171
00:45:51,148 --> 00:45:55,486
